testonce
Copyright (c) 2026 The Aura Farming Company of New York LLC.

This software is source-available. It is not open source in the OSI sense.

1. Free for everyone

   You may use, copy, modify and run this software for any purpose, including
   commercial use, at no charge, subject to section 2.

2. Paid features need a seat for commercial use

   The paid features are (a) the shared cache: the `testonce share`
   command and any other way of moving testonce's test records between
   machines, checkouts or users; and (b) the add-ons: the `testonce
   flaky`, `shard`, `order`, `report` and `fix` commands and the code in
   src/addons/; and (c) the connectors: the `testonce mcp` and `testonce api`
   commands, the code in src/connectors/, and the hosted API and MCP endpoint. Using a paid feature for or inside a for-profit organization
   requires a subscription to that feature (or a bundle that includes it) with
   one seat per person who uses it or whose tests use it; the connectors are
   licensed per organization instead of per seat. CI runners and bots
   do not need their own seat. Personal projects, education, non-profits and
   public open-source projects may use every feature free. Terms and buy links
   are in COMMERCIAL.md.

3. Conditions

   Keep this notice in copies and substantial portions of the software. Do not
   remove, disable or work around section 2, and do not offer the paid features
   to others as a hosted or managed service.

4. No warranty

   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
   IMPLIED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AURA FARMING COMPANY OF NEW YORK LLC BE
   LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE SOFTWARE
   OR ITS USE, INCLUDING ANY TEST THAT WAS SKIPPED.
